## 4. Problem Statement

> *"To design and develop an AI-powered, full-stack web application that enables users to generate unique saree designs through natural-language prompts using generative AI, add them to a shopping cart, and place orders — while providing store administrators with a real-time dashboard for order analytics and management."*

