## 14. Limitations of the Current System

1. **No persistent cart** — Cart items are lost on page refresh.
2. **No payment gateway integration** — Only COD and manual UPI options.
3. **No user order history** — Users cannot view past orders.
4. **Mock product specifications** — Saree specs (fabric, weave, etc.) are randomly generated, not linked to the AI image.
5. **No admin authentication** — The admin panel is accessible without login.
6. **Single-server architecture** — Not horizontally scalable in current form.
7. **AI dependency on external service** — Puter.js availability is required for image generation.

